<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bebas+Neue&family=Outfit:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style>
:root {
  --mg-red:     #c8352e;
  --mg-dark:    #0a0a0a;
  --mg-text:    #3a3a3a;
  --mg-muted:   #71717a;
  --mg-surface: #f5f5f3;
  --mg-border:  #e4e4e7;
}

.title { display: none !important; }

.sg {
  font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
  font-weight: 300;
  font-size: 1.05rem;
  line-height: 1.8;
  color: var(--mg-text);
  max-width: 760px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}

.sg-h1 {
  font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
  font-size: clamp(2.2rem, 5vw, 3.2rem);
  color: var(--mg-dark);
  letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
}

.sg-h2 {
  font-family: 'Bebas Neue', sans-serif;
  font-size: 1.5rem;
  color: var(--mg-dark);
  margin: 2.5rem 0 1rem;
  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--mg-surface);
  padding-bottom: 0.3rem;
}

.sg-fit-notice {
  background: var(--mg-surface);
  border: 1px solid var(--mg-border);
  border-left: 4px solid var(--mg-red);
  border-radius: 4px;
  padding: 1.1rem 1.4rem;
  margin: 1.5rem 0 2rem;
  font-size: 0.95rem;
}

.sg-fit-notice strong {
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--mg-dark);
}

.sg-toggle {
  display: flex;
  background: var(--mg-surface);
  border: 1px solid var(--mg-border);
  border-radius: 50px;
  padding: 4px;
  width: fit-content;
  margin: 0 0 2rem;
  gap: 4px;
}

.sg-toggle-btn {
  padding: 10px 28px;
  border-radius: 50px;
  border: none;
  background: transparent;
  font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
  font-weight: 600;
  font-size: 0.85rem;
  letter-spacing: 0.05em;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  color: var(--mg-muted);
  cursor: pointer;
  transition: background 0.2s, color 0.2s;
}

.sg-toggle-btn.active {
  background: var(--mg-dark);
  color: #fff;
}

.sg-panel { display: none; }
.sg-panel.active { display: block; }

.sg-table-wrap { overflow-x: auto; margin: 0 0 2.5rem; }

.sg-table {
  width: 100%;
  border-collapse: collapse;
  font-size: 0.93rem;
}

.sg-table th {
  font-family: 'Outfit', sans-serif;
  font-weight: 700;
  font-size: 0.7rem;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  color: var(--mg-muted);
  background: var(--mg-surface);
  border-bottom: 2px solid var(--mg-border);
  padding: 0.6rem 0.85rem;
  text-align: left;
  white-space: nowrap;
}

.sg-table td {
  padding: 0.6rem 0.85rem;
  border-bottom: 1px solid var(--mg-border);
  color: var(--mg-text);
}

.sg-table tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }

.sg-table td:first-child {
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--mg-dark);
}

.sg-age {
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  color: var(--mg-muted);
  font-weight: 400;
}

.sg-note {
  font-size: 0.88rem;
  color: var(--mg-muted);
  border-top: 1px solid var(--mg-border);
  padding-top: 1.25rem;
  margin-top: 1rem;
}

.sg-note strong { color: var(--mg-dark); }
.sg-note a { color: var(--mg-red); }

@media (max-width: 600px) {
  .sg-toggle { width: 100%; }
  .sg-toggle-btn { flex: 1; text-align: center; padding: 10px 12px; font-size: 0.78rem; }
  .sg-table th, .sg-table td { font-size: 0.8rem; padding: 0.5rem 0.6rem; }
  .hide-sm { display: none; }
}
</style>

<div class="sg">
  <h1 class="sg-h1">Guía de Tallas</h1>

  <div class="sg-fit-notice">
    <strong>Nuestras camisetas tienen un corte atlético ajustado.</strong>
    Si estás entre dos tallas o prefieres una mayor holgura en el campo,
    <strong>te recomendamos elegir la talla superior.</strong>
    Todas las medidas son corporales — no del tejido.
  </div>

  <div class="sg-toggle" role="tablist">
    <button class="sg-toggle-btn active" data-panel="adult" role="tab">Adultos</button>
    <button class="sg-toggle-btn" data-panel="kids" role="tab">Niños / Juvenil</button>
  </div>

  <!-- ── ADULTOS ── -->
  <div class="sg-panel active" id="sg-adult">

    <h2 class="sg-h2">Camisetas de Fútbol</h2>
    <div class="sg-table-wrap">
      <table class="sg-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Talla</th>
            <th>Pecho (cm)</th>
            <th class="hide-sm">Peso (kg)</th>
            <th>Altura (cm)</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>XS</td><td>86–91</td><td class="hide-sm">50–60</td><td>160–165</td></tr>
          <tr><td>S</td><td>91–96</td><td class="hide-sm">60–70</td><td>165–170</td></tr>
          <tr><td>M</td><td>96–101</td><td class="hide-sm">70–80</td><td>170–175</td></tr>
          <tr><td>L</td><td>101–106</td><td class="hide-sm">80–90</td><td>175–180</td></tr>
          <tr><td>XL</td><td>106–111</td><td class="hide-sm">90–100</td><td>180–185</td></tr>
          <tr><td>2XL</td><td>111–116</td><td class="hide-sm">100–110</td><td>185–190</td></tr>
          <tr><td>3XL</td><td>116–121</td><td class="hide-sm">110–120</td><td>190–195</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <h2 class="sg-h2">Pantalones Cortos de Fútbol</h2>
    <div class="sg-table-wrap">
      <table class="sg-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Talla</th>
            <th>Cintura (cm)</th>
            <th class="hide-sm">Caderas (cm)</th>
            <th>Altura (cm)</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>XS</td><td>73–90</td><td class="hide-sm">85–90</td><td>160–180</td></tr>
          <tr><td>S</td><td>79–96</td><td class="hide-sm">91–96</td><td>165–185</td></tr>
          <tr><td>M</td><td>85–102</td><td class="hide-sm">97–102</td><td>170–190</td></tr>
          <tr><td>L</td><td>91–108</td><td class="hide-sm">103–108</td><td>175–195</td></tr>
          <tr><td>XL</td><td>97–114</td><td class="hide-sm">109–114</td><td>180–200</td></tr>
          <tr><td>2XL</td><td>103–120</td><td class="hide-sm">115–120</td><td>185–205</td></tr>
          <tr><td>3XL</td><td>109–126</td><td class="hide-sm">121–126</td><td>185–205</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

  </div>

  <!-- ── NIÑOS / JUVENIL ── -->
  <div class="sg-panel" id="sg-kids">

    <h2 class="sg-h2">Camisetas de Fútbol — Niños / Juvenil</h2>
    <div class="sg-table-wrap">
      <table class="sg-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Talla</th>
            <th>Pecho (cm)</th>
            <th class="hide-sm">Peso (kg)</th>
            <th>Altura (cm)</th>
            <th>Edad (aprox.)</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>98/104</td><td>54–58</td><td class="hide-sm">15–18</td><td>96–104</td><td class="sg-age">3–4 años</td></tr>
          <tr><td>110/116</td><td>58–64</td><td class="hide-sm">18–22</td><td>105–117</td><td class="sg-age">5–6 años</td></tr>
          <tr><td>128</td><td>64–70</td><td class="hide-sm">22–28</td><td>123–128</td><td class="sg-age">7–8 años</td></tr>
          <tr><td>140</td><td>70–76</td><td class="hide-sm">28–36</td><td>135–140</td><td class="sg-age">9–10 años</td></tr>
          <tr><td>152</td><td>76–82</td><td class="hide-sm">34–42</td><td>147–152</td><td class="sg-age">11–12 años</td></tr>
          <tr><td>164</td><td>82–88</td><td class="hide-sm">40–52</td><td>159–164</td><td class="sg-age">13–14 años</td></tr>
          <tr><td>176</td><td>88–94</td><td class="hide-sm">52–63</td><td>170–176</td><td class="sg-age">15–16 años</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <h2 class="sg-h2">Pantalones Cortos de Fútbol — Niños / Juvenil</h2>
    <div class="sg-table-wrap">
      <table class="sg-table">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>Talla</th>
            <th>Cintura (cm)</th>
            <th class="hide-sm">Caderas (cm)</th>
            <th>Altura (cm)</th>
            <th>Edad (aprox.)</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>98/104</td><td>52–55</td><td class="hide-sm">58–61</td><td>96–104</td><td class="sg-age">3–4 años</td></tr>
          <tr><td>110/116</td><td>54–58</td><td class="hide-sm">62–66</td><td>105–117</td><td class="sg-age">5–6 años</td></tr>
          <tr><td>128</td><td>59–62</td><td class="hide-sm">68–71</td><td>123–128</td><td class="sg-age">7–8 años</td></tr>
          <tr><td>140</td><td>63–67</td><td class="hide-sm">74–79</td><td>135–140</td><td class="sg-age">9–10 años</td></tr>
          <tr><td>152</td><td>66–72</td><td class="hide-sm">79–84</td><td>147–152</td><td class="sg-age">11–12 años</td></tr>
          <tr><td>164</td><td>71–75</td><td class="hide-sm">86–90</td><td>159–164</td><td class="sg-age">13–14 años</td></tr>
          <tr><td>176</td><td>74–78</td><td class="hide-sm">90–95</td><td>170–176</td><td class="sg-age">15–16 años</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

  </div>

  <div class="sg-note">
    <p><strong>¿No estás seguro de tu talla?</strong> Mide tu pecho en el punto más ancho y tu altura sin zapatos, luego compara con la tabla. En caso de duda, elige la talla superior — las camisetas personalizadas no se pueden cambiar una vez impresas.</p>
    <p>¿Preguntas? <a href="/pages/contacto">Contacta con nuestro equipo</a> — estamos encantados de ayudarte antes de realizar tu pedido.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
(function () {
  var btns = document.querySelectorAll('.sg-toggle-btn');
  btns.forEach(function (btn) {
    btn.addEventListener('click', function () {
      btns.forEach(function (b) { b.classList.remove('active'); });
      btn.classList.add('active');
      document.querySelectorAll('.sg-panel').forEach(function (p) { p.classList.remove('active'); });
      document.getElementById('sg-' + btn.dataset.panel).classList.add('active');
    });
  });
}());
</script>
